@startuml
title FiscalWave - temporary AWS learning lab (NOT production)
skinparam shadowing false
node "Developer PC / local CI" as Dev
cloud "AWS account - sandbox only" {
  rectangle "CloudFront + S3\nMFE static artifacts (optional lab)" as Static
  rectangle "Application Load Balancer\nHourly/LCU charges" as ALB
  node "ECS / Fargate (short lived)" {
    component "Fiscal API task A" as A
    component "Fiscal API task B" as B
  }
  queue "SQS / DLQ" as SQS
  component "Lambda Java" as Lambda
  folder "S3 private documents" as S3
  database "RDS (optional; costly)" as RDS
  rectangle "IAM + budget alerts + tags\nTerraform destroy" as Guard
}
Dev --> Static : browser
Dev --> ALB : test HTTPS
ALB --> A : health checks + routes
ALB --> B : health checks + routes
A --> SQS : event
SQS --> Lambda : worker
Lambda --> S3 : IAM role only
A --> RDS : optional lab
B --> RDS : optional lab
Guard .. ALB
Guard .. RDS
Guard .. Lambda
note bottom
No always-on NAT Gateway, EKS or RDS in the initial lab.
Budget alerts are not a guaranteed hard spending cap.
All billable resources require owner approval and teardown.
end note
@enduml
